        "t": 150.00262500000008,
        "r": 537.5639999999999,
        "b": 123.74512500000003
      },
      "content": "The  popular  standard  for  the  overall  system  accuracy  is  AAMI,  SP-10  1992;  1996 (Electronic or automated sphygmomanometers).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1056",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
